# 2026-09-20: the CodeBuddy harness's own state directory (settings.local.json,
# worktrees/). Not repo content. worktrees/ holds a SECOND full checkout of this
# repo, and leaving it visible made check-dead-refs.py index that checkout as if
# it were this tree's docs: 211 unresolved references across 44 docs, every one of
# them under .codebuddy/worktrees/ and none of them this repo's. Ignoring the
# directory removes both the status noise and the false findings, through the
# checker's existing git-ignored skip rather than a new rule of its own.
/.codebuddy/
/.tmp